      "text": "To assess progression, 4,450 patients with early or intermediate AMD were matched between the cohorts. GLP-1RA use was associated with 29% relative risk reduction in progression to advanced nonexudative AMD (RR, 0.715; 95% CI, 0.529-0.967; P = 0.028) and a 27% relative risk reduction in progression to exudative AMD (RR, 0.729; 95% CI, 0.601-0.883; P = 0.001).",
