      "text": "CONCLUSION: GLP-1RA use may reduce both the risk and progression of AMD and progression of early and intermediate AMD to advanced AMD in adults with T2DM.",
      "score": 1,
      "rationale": "Supports reduced AMD progression with GLP-1RA use, though it does not specifically isolate exudative AMD progression."
    }
  ]
